        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "Often recipes requiring manual mixing will have an automatic counterpart using a $(item)Mixer$() attachment. Place the mixer above the mixing bowl with a 1 block gap and power it with $(thing)Rotational Force$() to begin recipes. Sometimes mixers require a minimum rpm, or a circuit number. Set the circuit number on the side of the mixer to use it."
